# Edge redirects for the web deployment.
# Copied verbatim into dist/ by `expo export -p web`.
#
# There are intentionally no rules here. The root path is the consumer app
# (task wall) and /admin is the operator platform, so nothing needs rewriting at
# the edge — client-side routing handles both.
#
# Do NOT add a `/* /index.html 200` catch-all: redirect rules are applied even
# when a real asset matches the request, so a catch-all would shadow the hashed
# JS bundles under /_expo/. The SPA fallback comes from
# `assets.not_found_handling = "single-page-application"` in wrangler.toml
# instead (Cloudflare Pages does the same fallback automatically when the
# deployment has no 404.html).
